    77	- A store without `listFor` is answered with `UNSUPPORTED`, never an empty list, because a client cannot tell "no conversations" from "the server could not look" ([validated by: refuses list_conversations when the store cannot list](../../src/transport/ws/messageHandler.test.ts#L157)).
    78	- The validator accepts an optional non-negative integer `limit` and an optional `before` cursor whose `sessionId` is 1–128 characters and whose `updatedAt` parses as a valid timestamp, rejecting any other `list_sessions` payload with `INVALID_MESSAGE` without calling `listFor` ([validated by: accepts a bare list_sessions frame and rejects a malformed limit or before with INVALID_MESSAGE without calling listFor](../../src/transport/conversationList.acceptance.test.ts#L164)).

